WEBVTT

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.090
We'll be fine if we have all these!

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:11.780
Do you think Master Cain will be happy?

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:13.120
Of course.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:16.570
Now, let us get started, Miglieglia.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:17.790
Yeah!

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:06.980
Those Who Seek

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:14.070
Your soul has actually been broken 
for quite some time now, I see.

00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:19.240
Captain, are you trying to 
say that you're not broken?

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:24.280
I know too well how your face looked 
all those times on the battlefield!

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:29.390
How your face looked at Whitechurch!

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:40.890
Oh? I think this is your best face yet.

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:44.960
Well done, Captain. I'm all excited now.

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:46.890
Here I come, Miles!

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:58.380
Hank Henriette... The former 
Incarnate squad captain, eh?

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:01.330
So you knew?

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:02.940
Don't worry.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:08.660
There are times when you must deceive 
your allies on the battlefield.

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:19.680
As if you can stop me!

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:26.930
What?!

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:32.940
D-Damn it!

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:34.600
Good.

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:35.550
Sergeant!

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:42.660
Signal flare confirmed!

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:44.070
Fire!

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:54.910
What the hell was that for?

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:10.700
Well, that hurt.

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:13.940
It hurt, but it wasn't enough.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.140
I told you, I'm immortal.

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:20.660
Just try and shoot me!

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:23.310
You've got those Godkiller bullets, right?!

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:25.660
What the...

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:31.860
This is...

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:33.510
Abi's!

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:42.340
Get away from here!

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:43.580
Don't touch the mist!

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.770
Fall back! Fall back!

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:53.630
What... is this?!

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:57.940
It appears that the plan went well.

00:04:58.300 --> 00:05:00.410
What is that?

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:02.420
What did you use?!

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:06.830
A new weapon that was created after 
researching the Incarnate Hydra's corpse.

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:09.900
A decaying poisonous mist: Alphard.

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:12.580
A gift from the president himself.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:14.980
My father sent... No...

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:18.460
Look at how many casualties 
it cost our side!

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:21.630
This is all to exterminate the Beasts.

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:24.430
What kind of plan prioritizes 
causing casualties?!

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:28.630
This is not some hunting trip. This is war!

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:34.790
It would have been even better if Hank 
Henriette had also been caught in the mist.

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:37.070
How could you?!

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:40.870
Having an open mind is one 
of the keys to longevity.

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:45.580
We were able to take down a powerful 
Incarnate and find a way into the fortress.

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:47.480
Do you have a problem with that?

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:54.420
This hurts. Man, this hurts.

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:56.740
I heal, but I just keep falling apart.

00:05:57.210 --> 00:06:01.960
To think the last scream I hear 
would be my own... That's hilarious.

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:04.030
Miles...

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:07.550
Judging by the look on your face, 
you didn't know about this.

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:09.400
That's hilarious.

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:11.050
The sheer clownery.

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:18.680
Looks like this is the end of the line.

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:25.460
Well, see ya.

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:30.010
Make sure you play with Cain 
before coming to see me again.

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:37.960
I'm getting a head start.

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:50.880
Who are y—

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:53.140
He's...

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:54.090
What's he doing here?!

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:54.470
Gather the troops!

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:55.360
Report to the colonel!

00:06:55.740 --> 00:07:00.280
Now, let's use this momentum to take 
down that fortress as quickly as possible.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:04.870
What's all that ruckus?

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:06.590
Colonel Wall! There's—

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:10.670
It can't be...

00:07:21.010 --> 00:07:22.410
Go hide!

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:28.870
The leader of the insurgents greets us 
personally? You must be quite confident.

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:39.980
Don't! Those weapons won't have any effect on—

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:41.350
Shoot him dead!

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:50.580
What's going on?

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:52.480
We're hitting him, but it's not working!

00:07:58.030 --> 00:07:59.530
Grenadiers!

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:04.630
Huh?

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:05.760
He's gone.

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:07.800
Where did he—

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:21.880
S-Stop—

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:26.490
What?

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:29.010
Now what?!

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:32.870
What the...

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:35.080
Sergeant, I'm leaving the fortress to you!

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:36.000
Right.

00:08:38.060 --> 00:08:39.240
<i>Schaal...</i>

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:54.800
So...

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:57.140
This is it?

00:08:57.750 --> 00:09:00.600
I'd call this playing dirty,

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.030
and I'm afraid I can't let that go.

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:12.060
Say, Claude.

00:09:12.390 --> 00:09:18.570
Wouldn't you say the humans who use such 
terrifying methods are the true beasts here?

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:21.240
Shut up!

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:23.970
You're in no position to talk!

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:26.030
My poor little brother...

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:28.760
I see you're still that man's puppet.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:34.500
Here, you can have this back.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:36.550
Savor it.

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:51.960
Cain Madhouse, you traitor.

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:53.930
This time, I'll finish you off for good!

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:01.540
You're shaking.

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:03.690
This is what they call fear.

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.110
Shut up!

00:10:17.020 --> 00:10:18.560
My little brother...

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:20.960
At least be of some use to me.

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:32.850
Hank!

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:37.270
So you've come, Hank...

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:45.270
Schaal, take care of Claude.

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:46.370
Right!

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:47.250
Cain!

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:50.120
Why did you come here in person?

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:52.260
There should be other Incarnates.

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:55.200
I know you're not a fool, 
but it appears this battle

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:58.740
you've been waging all alone 
has narrowed your view.

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:04.070
Both you and his father are careless.

00:11:04.070 --> 00:11:06.180
Don't tell me... This was a diversion?!

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:10.180
Soon, we will forge an 
alliance with the South!

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:11.250
What?!

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:17.140
I went ahead and arranged a few things 
while you were busy with this fortress.

00:11:17.140 --> 00:11:20.970
That can't be true! The South 
should be maintaining neutrality!

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:21.560
And—

00:11:21.560 --> 00:11:24.610
They were supposed to sign a 
secret agreement with the North,

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:28.730
and fight against my New Patria... right?

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:32.830
Capital of the Southern Confederation of Patria
 San Alta

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:39.340
The Southern leaders you were dealing with

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:43.450
are probably corpses right about now, 
regretting their decisions.

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:49.590
That's not an alliance at all!
 That's an invasion!

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:54.580
Now the power balance in this 
world is really going to change!

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:57.710
I will stop you!

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:03.710
Let me retract what I said earlier.

00:12:03.710 --> 00:12:05.800
You truly are a fool, Hank.

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:09.980
Didn't you learn anything as 
you watched Centaurus die?

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:12.740
Look at that horrendous sight!

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:15.750
This is the true nature of the humans

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:18.680
you want to protect at the cost 
of killing your own comrades!

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:23.630
How are they any different from the 
Incarnates who, as you say, lost their souls?!

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:26.650
Humans are deranged creatures.

00:12:26.650 --> 00:12:30.240
Otherwise, Incarnates would 
never have been born!

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:31.370
That being the case,

00:12:31.780 --> 00:12:35.230
shouldn't you be thanking me?
 Since I killed Elaine,

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:37.620
the one who created all of this?

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:39.060
Well, Hank?

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:45.270
It's true. Incarnates might've been created

00:12:45.270 --> 00:12:48.190
by the madness of Elaine... 
of all human beings.

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:53.100
But Elaine realized her mistake 
and tried to correct it.

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:56.300
She was prepared for all of us to hate her.

00:12:57.410 --> 00:13:00.780
No matter how many mistakes they make, 
they will always try to do the right thing.

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:03.480
That's what humans do.

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:07.590
That's exactly why I'm
 carrying out Elaine's wishes.

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:09.510
I will fulfill our oath from that day.

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:12.510
I can't let you all turn into beasts.

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:17.320
We should've perished along with that war!

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:22.210
You say the most obvious things.

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:25.690
Who's going to see this 
righteousness through, then?!

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:27.680
Will it be you, Hank?!

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:30.440
No one could possibly understand that!

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:34.700
What's truly righteous is decided 
by those who survive!

00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:41.290
That's why I'm going to 
continue living as I desire.

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:42.540
Cain...

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:18.140
Stop lying to yourself!

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:20.910
I know you felt it when you 
were at Whitechurch, too.

00:14:26.390 --> 00:14:29.000
The pleasure of being reborn...

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:31.430
The release of all the power 
you'd kept inside...

00:14:31.730 --> 00:14:34.570
How wonderful it must've felt 
to trample upon the weak!

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:42.730
What?

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:49.080
This is...

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:53.200
You shouldn't have an ability like this...

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:57.000
Indeed. Things aren't like 
they were back then.

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:02.210
Incarnates are not a mistake.
 They're a triumph!

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:12.450
You keep fighting your basic instincts, 
but once you can't fight them anymore,

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:15.180
you'll see how right I've been...

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:21.840
And then we shall usher 
in the era of the gods!

00:15:22.930 --> 00:15:26.320
There are no gods anywhere.

00:15:26.950 --> 00:15:29.610
You're nothing more than a Beast.

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:33.790
I will also end up a Beast someday.

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:37.620
We have no future!

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:44.110
Hank...

00:15:52.230 --> 00:15:53.790
Advance!

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:55.100
Damn it!

00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:17.960
Why don't you understand?

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:21.220
The time for revolution is upon us, Hank.

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:24.040
The Incarnates were just a prelude to that.

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:27.790
That's a foolish interpretation.

00:16:30.470 --> 00:16:32.780
I cannot bear to watch a man like yourself

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:35.970
get swallowed up by change 
and die for nothing.

00:16:38.690 --> 00:16:43.220
If possible, I truly want you to survive.

00:16:47.210 --> 00:16:49.190
As my friend.

00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:50.690
Hank!

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:53.830
I'm sure you realize

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:57.460
that you cannot defeat me as a mere human.

00:16:58.110 --> 00:17:01.420
I'll say this again... Join me!

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:04.200
You are the King of Beasts!

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:15.820
You're undoubtedly human just like us, Hank.

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:20.780
So, Hank, please continue to 
slay your friends who have

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:23.060
lost their souls while they're still human.

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:27.140
In order to fulfill your oath,

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:31.840
you need to survive as long as you can!

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.000
Schaal...

00:17:55.560 --> 00:17:59.220
You're just a human...

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:19.230
Die, little girl!

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:26.130
A lowly human like you

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:29.670
isn't allowed to enter our world!

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:39.420
"Our world" doesn't exist, Cain!

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:42.300
Hank...

00:19:37.700 --> 00:19:39.070
Hank!

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:42.750
Are you all right?

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:44.930
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:49.070
This is it...

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:53.080
This is the power of the King of Beasts, 
which surpasses that of the Incarnates!

00:20:03.240 --> 00:20:05.060
Looks like it's finished.

00:20:05.690 --> 00:20:08.680
It's a shame, but it appears 
the time has come for me to go.

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:13.070
Let us meet again, Hank.

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:16.310
And you as well, the next Gleipnir girl.

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:37.370
<i>The Bold Creek fortress fell at 
the hands of the Northern army.</i>

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:42.790
<i>The North was able to avoid the 
impending attack on their capital.</i>

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:48.210
<i>But the free nation of New Patria, 
led by Cain Madhouse,</i>

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:53.290
<i>took control of the West and the South and,</i>

00:20:53.290 --> 00:20:57.600
<i>as a result, became the 
strongest nation in Patria.</i>

00:20:59.350 --> 00:21:05.360
<i>Realizing this, the president of the 
Northern Union of Patria, Richard Withers,</i>

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:11.340
<i>declared a state of emergency and called 
all their forces back to the capital.</i>

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:19.130
<i>The times were trying to bring 
forth another turbulent wave.</i>

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:25.920
Be careful, you hear?

00:21:25.920 --> 00:21:28.640
I'll join you guys as soon as 
I take care of a few things.

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:29.630
Right!

00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:31.560
Do you really have to go?

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:34.100
You can stay as long as you want, Schaal.

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:37.270
I can't help but notice a difference here!

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:40.280
We need some comfort, too!

00:21:40.280 --> 00:21:43.680
I have all the comfort you'll 
ever need... right here!

00:21:44.230 --> 00:21:47.090
Nah... You just don't get it,
 Second Lieutenant.

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:48.180
Sorry.

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:57.300
Aren't you satisfied with the outcome?

00:21:58.700 --> 00:22:04.020
Our duty is to defeat all of the 
Incarnates that threaten this world.

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:08.220
We should take the most 
reliable steps to do that...

00:22:08.760 --> 00:22:12.300
At least, while that man 
still retains his sanity.

00:22:13.080 --> 00:22:14.630
I know that.

00:22:18.560 --> 00:22:20.730
You've really changed.

00:22:21.800 --> 00:22:26.820
When we first met, you didn't 
belong in the same world as me.

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:29.430
Well, a lot has happened.

00:22:29.850 --> 00:22:32.670
But you've changed, too, Hank.

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:36.970
You smile more often now.

00:22:37.490 --> 00:22:42.110
That's because you decided 
to be there for us Incarnates.

00:22:44.320 --> 00:22:45.710
Are you sure about this?

00:22:46.860 --> 00:22:50.880
You're going to continuously be putting 
yourself in the middle of the battle.

00:22:52.700 --> 00:22:54.940
This isn't for you, Hank.

00:22:55.430 --> 00:22:58.720
I found my own goal.

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:02.230
I'm going with you.

00:23:03.140 --> 00:23:07.080
So I can keep my oath to you.

00:23:09.060 --> 00:23:10.050
I see.

00:23:28.400 --> 00:23:30.970
Are you watching, Elaine?

00:23:31.280 --> 00:23:35.230
The new world you tried to kill has arrived.
